{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1344487-conversion-from-universe-to-continuum","id":1344487,"title":"Conversion from Universe to Continuum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-29T13:23:17-07:00","id":1344487,"title":"Conversion from Universe to Continuum","content":"Is there any kind of conversion guide to adapt material/adventures from the White Wolf era to the current Trinity Continuum? I remember really liking the &quot;Darkness Revealed&quot; set of adventures from the old system and would prefer not to have to build the characters for them from near-scratch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T09:17:13-07:00","id":1344674,"title":"","content":"I don't think there will be such a thing, the systems seem a little too different in key places.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T09:45:07-07:00","id":1344680,"title":"","content":"Antagonists are intentionally easy to make. I don't have the old module though, is there an example character you have and we could walk though adapting them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T11:36:47-07:00","id":1344702,"title":"","content":"Like Morose Morgan said, it\u2019s easy to create antagonists, just pick a focus for primary and secondary pools and it\u2019s basically done. You can also use the same dice pools as before, Trinity dice pools were not as bizarre as Aberrant, so probably going to be enough. The issue is only if you want to keep the old modes or the new ones in use, there are several differences and the adaptation can be tricky.<br /> <br /> In the case of the Aberrants I suggest redoing them from scratch, it\u2019s not hard, it\u2019s more about powers, just need to pick the powers described in Aeon that fit on the adversary description. Just to give the same feel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T15:45:10-07:00","id":1344763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1344487-conversion-from-universe-to-continuum?p=1344680#post1344680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Antagonists are intentionally easy to make. I don't have the old module though, is there an example character you have and we could walk though adapting them?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd need to dig it out, but yes. I don't think I'd be allowed to directly posted text/stats from the original WW game. However, there were a few fan-created modules I still have and I could post some stuff from them.<br /> <br /> What I'm ultimately working toward is a kind of &quot;sliding doors&quot; campaign in which the characters find themselves travelling (at first unknowingly) between not only different universes but different times within those universes. So folks from modern Continuum might end up in the future Trinity Continuum and then &quot;slide&quot; over to the WW Trinity Universe and even the WW Adventure or Aberrant.<br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Allegiance: </span><span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Legion<br /> <br /> Physical Attributes Strength 4 Dexterity 4 Stamina 4 </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Mental Attributes Perception 4 Intelligence 4 Wits 3<br /> <br /> Social Attributes Appearance 3 Manipulation 2 Charisma 3</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Abilities<br /> Brawl 3, Might 3<br /> Athletics 2, Firearms 3, Melee 3, Pilot 4 Endurance 1, Resistance 2 </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Abilities<br /> Awareness 3<br /> Bureaucracy 2, Engineering 2, Survival 3 </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Abilities<br /> Intimidation 2<br /> Command 4, Interrogation 2 Savvy 2</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Aptitude: </span><span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">[Psychokinesis] Photokinesis 3, Pyrokinesis 2, Telekinesis 4 </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Backgrounds: </span><span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Citizenship1 Resources 3 Status (Legion) 3 </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Willpower: </span><span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">8</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Psi: </span><span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">5</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">Gear: </span><span style=\"font-family:TimesNewRoman\">L-K Avenger 11mm Heavy autopistol, Steinhardt VirtuX minicomp, military- access ID </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":".  Adding the stats 10-30-2019, 07:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T18:45:05-07:00","id":1344795,"title":"","content":"Primary: 8 (piloting and combat)<br /> Secondary: 6 (Military law and procedures)<br /> Desperation: 4<br /> Enhancement: 2<br /> Edges (6): Wealth 3, Patron 2 (legion), pick one like sniper or cool under fire.<br /> Health 5<br /> Defence: 4<br /> Psi: 5 (modes as before, but are you sure it\u2019s Photokinesis and not Crio?)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T20:15:49-07:00","id":1344813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1344487-conversion-from-universe-to-continuum?p=1344795#post1344795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Primary: 8 (piloting and combat)<br /> Secondary: 6 (Military law and procedures)<br /> Desperation: 4<br /> Enhancement: 2<br /> Edges (6): Wealth 3, Patron 2 (legion), pick one like sniper or cool under fire.<br /> Health 5<br /> Defence: 4<br /> Psi: 5 (modes as before, but are you sure it\u2019s Photokinesis and not Crio?)<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>It's almost certainly Cryokinesis 3. This was a very, very early fan-made (or possibly freebie White Wolf) adventure. Aside from a limited edition published on October 1997, the Trinity core book was published on November 1997. The next thing out was Hidden Agenda with the Storyteller Screen that came out in February of 1998. I'm pretty sure that Echo Station preceded that book by a couple of months of so. In those early days there was quite a bit of creativity and weirdness. People were a bit fascinated by Quantakinetics and there was one homebrew adventure set in a space station near Mars involving a cult led by a Psiad and a Quant that were trying to create a new Prometheus chamber. Or something.<br /> <br /> I don't have a digital copy of it anymore, but I think I still have printed paper copies of it and something called The Ruby Feather. At some point I'll try to dig them out and hopefully make scans of them to re-post online, perhaps in a thread here or somewhere else accessible and free to access.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 10-30-2019, 11:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T12:12:18-07:00","id":1345293,"title":"","content":"Posting a portion of a character write-up would most likely fall under fair use, so I don't think you'll be hearing from any lawyers. Mateus' writeup seems pretty straightforward though. Maybe just take some notes ahead of time what some of the power usage would look like, pool, preferred tags, range, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T12:25:33-07:00","id":1345298,"title":"","content":"My approach started from the legion allegiance, primary on his high physical + combat and pilot skills, secondary on medium social combining with high command and a fair amount of dots in skills law and investigation, common to military police or military lawers. It could represent a different set of skills and focus if the allegiance was different. Maybe a torturer if was a free Psion or a merc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}